Package: videoforensics
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libicu70 | libicu71 | libicu72, libssl3, ca-certificates, zlib1g
Maintainer: DV Victim Protection Team <noreply@example.com>
Description: VideoForensics web application and API server
 VideoForensics is a comprehensive platform for managing and analyzing video
 evidence from multiple providers. It provides unified device discovery, media
 download, and forensic analysis capabilities for video surveillance systems.
